# Build context for autotunex/Dockerfile, which builds from the REPOSITORY ROOT.
# BuildKit reads this file in place of the root .dockerignore (which serves the
# gbserver image and excludes autotunex/ altogether). It is an allowlist:
# everything is out unless re-included below, so nothing new at the root, and no
# local secret, can drift into the image.
*

# AutoTuneX itself.
!autotunex/pyproject.toml
!autotunex/README.md
!autotunex/src

# granite.build, for the gb-wheel stage of the llmb backend. .git carries the
# version tags setuptools_scm stamps the version from.
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!.git
!src
!test
!configurations

# Never: caches, local env files, build outputs.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
autotunex/src/ux/build
autotunex/src/ux/.svelte-kit
